  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# System Flow Sketch\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Use this space to visually support your explanation of how your app works as a system.\r\n\r\nThis sketch is **not** about designing a final UI or planning features. It is a thinking tool to help you explain user interactions, logic, and how information moves through your app.\r\n\r\nYou may use this sketch to:\r\n- show how a user moves through your app\r\n- illustrate what happens when a user takes an action\r\n- visualize how information flows from input to processing to display\r\n\r\nYou can also choose to explain your system in words and use the System Explanation Chat instead of sketching.\r\n\r\n### Optional Focus Areas\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **If your capstone is completed *after Unit 3*, your sketch may help explain:**]\r\n- how local data structures (arrays or objects) are used\r\n- how user input affects system behavior\r\n- how data moves through the app from input → processing → display\r\n:::\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **If your capstone is completed *after Unit 5*, your sketch may help explain:**]\r\n- where external data enters the system\r\n- where the system waits for information\r\n- where errors, empty states, or recovery paths may occur\r\n:::\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use this space to sketch how your app works as a system. You can show how users move through the app and how information flows from input to output. ***(supports completing Milestone 2)***.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/d2f6256449032ef4cee95fe915800e7c-mood-board.png",
    "display_name": "System Flow Sketch",
